abstract: "Uncalibrated dimensionless ODE models, noisy parameter fitting, training-only model selection, withheld-schedule prediction, frozen structural profiles, saved synthetic data, scientific tests and an offline original-trajectory viewer. Optimizer failures and post hoc sensitivity checks are retained. No clinical efficacy or empirical calibration is established."
